{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act49side_level_act49side_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act49side",
  "stageId": "act49side_01",
  "title": "激石波",
  "storyCode": "TA-1",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act49side/level_act49side_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "587ffc557129ca9f67132e280372c88021b0d8b91d861fd88affe8a98b3ec125",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=2>望日前三日</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......是雷声。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "只是雷声。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "已经是深秋了，要是拖到入冬，下了雪，路会很难走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "晖洁......你应当回去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "“回”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "回哪里去？龙门？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "你想知道的事，我都已经告诉你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "所以你应该明白，眼下的这些事，都与你无关。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "真想感叹......你大概也是真的老了，舅舅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "换作五年前的你，这会儿应该早已经和我动过手了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "你的性子到底也是变了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "留在这驿馆的几天，你的问题也并不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "因为我还是信不过你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你讲的那些事......关于那位太师，关于你的弟弟——我素未谋面的“另一位舅舅”，还有那位老真龙......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我没有权力对这些事评论什么。非要说的话，我倒是庆幸，最终不是由你来为炎国的许多事做决定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "这一点我同样不否认......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我的确还是想知道你离开百灶时到底在想什么，母亲为什么也跟着你来到龙门，又为何留了下来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "但我不指望在这个时候能从你口中听到一个公正的答案，听到你对那些往事最客观的陈述。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "所以我会自己搞清楚——我是不会走的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我知道你总有在关键的时候把事情搞砸的本事，尤其是在这种和你自己有关的事上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "就当是防止你再做蠢事也好，甚至是保护你也好——我都不会走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我们都省省吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "晖洁......你这些年——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "一样，也没什么好说的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "或许等到你愿意说的时候......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "陈晖洁向窗外看去。\n远处移动城市的灯火已经暗淡了数天，百灶城的轮廓在夜幕中模糊着，像是蛰伏巨兽的脊背。\n她试图去想象，那些对自己而言不久前才被证实的古老传说中的庞然巨物。\n细碎的秋雨不断敲打着窗户，声乱如麻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......还是没有消息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "那就已经是最好的消息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "事已至此，我们没办法期待任何好的转机。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你说，如果百灶城那边有任何异动......玉门就会立刻开战。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你所说的“岁兽”能造成的动乱，还有这一战的结果......无人可以确定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "这就是大炎隐藏了上千年的秘密......你们还真是一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "......可是事有蹊跷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "当下情势已经万分紧急，可过去十日，玉门和百灶之间来往的信使不超过三班。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "这不是玉门战时应该有的状态。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影卫",
      "text": "魏公，有客。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "这个时候......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "请进来就是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "魏公别来无恙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "太傅也安好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "您就是......炎国太傅？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "我之前的确不知道，陈家小姐也在这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "您为何......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "陈很确信自己从来没有见过这位老人。\n他那分不清是威严还是慈爱的目光从自己身上划过，只一眼，他就准确地认出了自己。\n紧接着，他又将那道令人捉摸不透的目光投向魏彦吾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "这是另一回事，说来话长。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "你的确听了我的意见，留在了这座驿馆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "我没有不信任太傅的道理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "之前是信使，今天是太傅亲自到这来......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "是有必须要和魏公说清的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "晖洁，回避。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "不必。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "一会要说的事，她最好也留下来听听。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "如今百灶城中境况......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "中秋后，陛下特准他进入岁陵，尝试平息岁兽之患。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "可望日临近，岁陵中依然没有动静。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "而此时此刻，大炎周遭还有五只巨兽盘踞，不知祂们意欲何为。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "天机阁的天师，还有大炎最精锐的战士已经前往巨兽所在的各地，大炎并不惮于这一战。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "但最坏的结果，不只是与五只巨兽同时开战。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "竟然......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音？",
      "text": "“不知意欲何为”——这白胡子老头倒是会说话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音？",
      "text": "上千年的血仇，这时候找上门，还能是来串门送礼的不成？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "嗯......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你......说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "这时候，应当已经有不少人力主开战了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "此刻重要的不再是某一派的意见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "只怕大炎已经没有选择。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "朝廷应当对此有过无数种预案。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "在无数种预案中，也不存在一种惨胜之外的结果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "但依然还有我们不曾考虑过的手段。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "太傅，告诉我，胞弟不曾想过要自己去开启“不反”——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "他是真龙，大炎的真龙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "如若大炎真到了不得已的时候，也只有他能行此事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "......简直荒唐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "魏公。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "事已至此，我们不必再顾左右而言他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "那封送到龙门的密信，在禁军动身前还无人知晓。而我今天来见魏公，却不曾掩人耳目。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "魏公应当明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "这些旧事......四十年的旧事，上千年的旧事......绝对不该以这种方式收场。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "......绝对不该，是由他去付出这个代价。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "无人愿意见到那个最坏的局面，但绝不可自欺欺人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "我有必要提醒魏公——哪怕只是为大炎计，为天下计。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "当留后手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "请等一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我不明白，太傅说的“后手”是什么意思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "您刚刚说的这些事，和魏彦吾......有什么关系？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音？",
      "text": "这还听不明白？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音？",
      "text": "后手就是后手，事情办砸的时候该做的事就叫后手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......什么......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你们......这是在说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音？",
      "text": "国不可一日无君，少了一位真龙，那自然得再补上一位真龙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音？",
      "text": "父死子替，兄退弟进，几千年来都是这么传过来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音？",
      "text": "要是别人都不在了，这女娃自然也是要去当真龙的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......你们在胡说八道什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "......晖洁！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "刚才的声音......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你们......都没听到？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "魏公。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "我不苛求魏公在此刻想清万般利害。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "行事当三思，但时间毕竟紧迫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "魏公，珍重。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "......我送太傅一程。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太傅",
      "text": "不必。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我不明白，那位太傅的意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "他特意让我留在这里，但我一点也听不明白你们所说的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "晖洁......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "什么叫炎国很有可能马上要大动干戈，却让你做好准备？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "“不反”“巨兽”......你和这些事到底有什么联系？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "晖洁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "过去曾有许多错......有的是我亲自铸就，有的则是我无力阻止。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "我唯一在坚持的，是不让那些已经无力改变的错，祸及你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "只因我从不曾怀疑，你能做到的比我们更多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......别在这时候说这些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "还有一事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "塔露拉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "告诉我，你上一次见到塔露拉，她还好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "不，我才不会在这个时候告诉你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "如果你真的还在乎她，就不要在这种时候问她的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "文月姨不愿意见你永远当那个老顽固，她在意你的安危，我也不想——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......如果你真的还在乎除了你自己之外的谁，就不要把他们全都抛在身后。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "告诉我，舅舅......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你到底准备做什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "听上去，她活得应当还好，至少不坏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......不要那样轻飘飘地下评判！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你还不知道她到底经历了什么牺牲，更不知道她最后——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "够了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你要是乐意这样，一个劲自顾自地对过去的事伤感个没完，那也随你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我要出去透透气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "细密的秋雨兀自缠绵，如同断续的思绪纠缠不休。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "魏彦吾，我对你和你的城市，你这座金玉其外败絮其中的城市......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "已经厌倦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你们要去哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "回到北方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "北边的矿场，那里有人需要我们的帮助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我们已经等不起了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "就在现在？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "这片农场呢，留在这里的人怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我们有的同胞会留下来，他们会彼此照顾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "如果你还愿意的话，也可以加入他们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......我不放心你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "你同样可以跟着我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "如果可以的话，我希望能获得你的帮助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "可是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "晖洁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我相信你说的，也许存在一个可以审判感染者......也可以收容所有感染者的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "但它不在这里，不在过去，不在现在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "它只会在将来，在我们要去的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "text": "我们要向前去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我们是向前走了......然后呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "过去的事到底是追了上来......还是我自己找了回去？呵，过去的事从来没有真的过去过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "塔露拉，如果是你......如果是你看到这些事，又会怎么想？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音",
      "text": "哼，瞻前顾后，优柔寡断，有勇无决。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音",
      "text": "这个娃娃，到底不像她的先祖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音",
      "text": "千年来，那位祖龙的后裔少说也有几万号人，其中英雄几何，庸才几何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音",
      "text": "这一点血脉又能决定多少事呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音",
      "text": "可是眼前这位至今依然浑浑噩噩，如在梦里，如何能以重任相委？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音",
      "text": "还是因为那几个老头子各个倔得像老木头，又硬又倔，嘴巴里三棍子打不出一句话，也不能怪这些晚辈担不起事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "模糊的声音",
      "text": "我看她这一路来造化也算不寻常，除了剑上的蛮功夫，应该多少有点过人之处才对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "到底是谁！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "别再装神弄鬼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......现身说话！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不知何处传来的飘渺声音再度响起，这一次才听得真切。\n陈晖洁这才确认今晚纠缠自己已久的絮语并非幻觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着朴素的老者",
      "text": "唉，瞧这丫头，见识不大脾气不小。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣着朴素的老者",
      "text": "有这份心倒是好事，你要是真想知道，你自己去看就是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "真是见鬼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "什么声音？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......是驿馆那边？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影卫",
      "text": "陈家小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你们都站在这里做什么......出什么事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影卫",
      "text": "小姐最后一次见到魏公是什么时候？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "不到半个时辰以前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影卫",
      "text": "看来您也不知魏公下落。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "等等，你们是说——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影卫",
      "text": "两刻前，魏公屏退我等，自己一人在房中休息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影卫",
      "text": "直到方才，店主送餐却发现房中无人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影卫",
      "text": "我们搜遍了整个驿馆，也不见魏公的踪影。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影卫",
      "text": "魏公现在......下落不明。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "没有留言。\n空着的旅舍如同不曾有客来过一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "这个人，竟然还能在你们眼皮底下溜走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "又一次......魏彦吾，又一次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影卫",
      "text": "小姐，之前魏公收到当今真龙亲笔，邀他赴京。我等劝阻无果，只得相随前来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影卫",
      "text": "姑且揣测，魏公现在已经前往京城。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影卫",
      "text": "我等未能护好魏公周全，罪无可赦。可若此刻擅闯京城，只怕——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "放心吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "陈打断了影卫的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "无论如何，他不辞而别总是事实。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "这次......我绝对会找到他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
